{
    "title": "ComiQuest - Comic Reader",
    "description": "Discover the Ultimate Comic Reading Experience!\r\n\r\nUnleash the full potential of your comic collection with our feature-packed comic reader app, designed to cater to all your reading needs. Whether you're a die-hard fan of graphic novels, manga, or webtoons, our app offers seamless compatibility with multiple formats and unparalleled convenience.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nMulti-Format Support: Effortlessly open and enjoy comics in ZIP, RAR, CBZ, CBR, and PDF formats. No need for multiple apps \u2013 we\u2019ve got you covered!\r\n\r\nEasy File Loading: Load your favorite comic books directly from local files or a USB stick. It's never been easier to access your entire library.\r\n\r\nReading Progress Tracker: Automatically track your reading progress for each book. Pick up right where you left off, every time.\r\n\r\nOrganize Your Collection: Create and manage custom collections to keep your comics organized. Whether by genre, series, or favorites, your library is always at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nAd-Free Experience: Enjoy uninterrupted reading with our completely ad-free interface. Focus on your comics without any distractions.\r\n\r\nBlue Light Filter: Reduce eye strain with our experimental blue light filter feature. Please note that this feature is currently experimental and does not work on PDF files. We are working on improving the functionality and support for all file formats in future updates.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Our App?\r\n\r\nDesigned with comic enthusiasts in mind, our app provides a smooth and enjoyable reading experience. From its intuitive interface to its powerful features, this app is the perfect companion for every comic lover.\r\n\r\nDownload now and dive into your favorite comics like never before!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the Ultimate Comic Reading Experience!<br><br>Unleash the full potential of your comic collection with our feature-packed comic reader app, designed to cater to all your reading needs. Whether you&#39;re a die-hard fan of graphic novels, manga, or webtoons, our app offers seamless compatibility with multiple formats and unparalleled convenience.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>Multi-Format Support: Effortlessly open and enjoy comics in ZIP, RAR, CBZ, CBR, and PDF formats. No need for multiple apps \u2013 we\u2019ve got you covered!<br><br>Easy File Loading: Load your favorite comic books directly from local files or a USB stick. It&#39;s never been easier to access your entire library.<br><br>Reading Progress Tracker: Automatically track your reading progress for each book. Pick up right where you left off, every time.<br><br>Organize Your Collection: Create and manage custom collections to keep your comics organized. Whether by genre, series, or favorites, your library is always at your fingertips.<br><br>Ad-Free Experience: Enjoy uninterrupted reading with our completely ad-free interface. Focus on your comics without any distractions.<br><br>Blue Light Filter: Reduce eye strain with our experimental blue light filter feature. Please note that this feature is currently experimental and does not work on PDF files. We are working on improving the functionality and support for all file formats in future updates.<br><br>Why Choose Our App?<br><br>Designed with comic enthusiasts in mind, our app provides a smooth and enjoyable reading experience. From its intuitive interface to its powerful features, this app is the perfect companion for every comic lover.<br><br>Download now and dive into your favorite comics like never before!",
